<node id="paper::broad_444fa95d3a7db533ade0::claim_1">
  <data key="d4">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d5">Strong atomic metal–support interaction stabilizes the dangling-bond-rich surface and enables a reconstruction-free surface, allowing Ru and Ni to function as steady dual reactive sites for HER and OER.</data>
  <data key="d18">reconstruction_free_bifunctionality</data>
  <data key="d19">Strong atomic metal–support interaction stabilizes the dangling-bond-rich surface and enables a reconstruction-free surface, allowing Ru and Ni to function as steady dual reactive sites for HER and OER.</data>
