  <data key="d5">The atomic Ru site stabilizes the Ni site against bond constriction and structural distortion during anodic OER and promotes an increase in the Ni oxidation state, contributing to superior OER performance.</data>
  <data key="d18">ni_stabilization_during_oer</data>
